<div class="mo" id="acsWifiModal">
  <div class="mb" style="max-width:480px">
    <div class="mh">
      <h3 class="mt"><i class="bi bi-wifi text-primary"></i> Kelola Wi-Fi Perangkat (TR-069)</h3>
      <button type="button" class="mc" onclick="closeModal('acsWifiModal')">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <form id="acsWifiForm" onsubmit="submitAcsWifi(event)">
      <div class="mbody">
        <input type="hidden" id="acs_wifi_device_id" value="">
        <div style="font-size:12px; padding:10px 14px; background:rgba(0,82,204,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(0,82,204,0.25); border-radius:10px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
          <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-1 text-primary"></i> Perubahan konfigurasi Wi-Fi akan langsung di-push ke modem pelanggan via TR-069.
        </div>
